=== I2. Parity split of Upsilon (exact, all 48 types) ===
  Lemma H2: every type pairs an even with an odd grade, so Shiab maps g_ev-valued forms to g_odd-valued ones and back: True
  (14,0): Q_t(T_e) and Q_t(T_o) have zero g_ev-part for all 48 types (random T_e, T_o): True; types with nonzero g_ev-part of Q_t(T_e + T_o) (= 2 B_t(T_e,T_o)_ev): 48
  (7,7): Q_t(T_e) and Q_t(T_o) have zero g_ev-part for all 48 types (random T_e, T_o): True; types with nonzero g_ev-part of Q_t(T_e + T_o) (= 2 B_t(T_e,T_o)_ev): 48
  => Upsilon_ev = Shiab(d_0 T_o) + kappa *T_e + 2 B(T_e, T_o)_ev  (linear in T_e); Upsilon_odd = Shiab F_0 + Shiab(d_0 T_e) + kappa *T_o + Q(T_o) + Q(T_e), since 2 B_t(T_e, T_o) = Q_t(T_e + T_o) - Q_t(T_e) - Q_t(T_o) has zero g_odd-part for all 48 types, both signatures: True

