  (14,0) W'_C.AdG : C(T) = 2 Psi(T_o ^ T_e ^ T_e): True (value 4); Q(T_o) = 0: True; Q(T_e) = (2/3) Shiab(T_e ^ T_e): True; but Shiab(T_o ^ T_o) != 0: True (cancelled by -h/3)
