  (7,7) W'_A, symmetric theta: Q(T) = *(M_ab e^a (x) gamma Gamma^b), M = a1 theta^2 + a2 tr(theta) theta + (a3 tr(theta^2) + a4 tr(theta)^2) g: {a1: 4/3, a2: -4/3, a3: -2/3, a4: 2/3} (392 exact equations, 2 samples)
